{"1843840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rogue Point", "steam_appid": 1843840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [3756640, 3756630], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creators of Black Mesa: When the richest CEO on Earth dies, cutthroat conglomerates seek to carve up his kingdom. Using the MERX app, rival tycoons can order private mercenary armies as easily as takeout, making them perfect soldiers for the corporate war! Only Rogue Point, an elite vigilante squad, dares to fight back.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/af8175a6c5f9ec5db142cd2716c3bb06.poster.avif?t=1786608108\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/af8175a6c5f9ec5db142cd2716c3bb06.webm?t=1786608108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/af8175a6c5f9ec5db142cd2716c3bb06.mp4?t=1786608108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/71d7ac3fa83e5f2cb6e36e7932e10fd6.webp?t=1786608108\" width=275 height=45 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into an adrenaline-fueled campaign where explosive co-op firefights meet strategic planning. Team up, gather intel, complete objectives, and battle through dynamic missions. Earn skills and upgrade weapons to confront the 5 Star Mercenaries, lethal contractors who will test the limits of your team.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/46581ec70b8a93ce4cb7912555b5bc66.poster.avif?t=1786608108\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/46581ec70b8a93ce4cb7912555b5bc66.webm?t=1786608108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/46581ec70b8a93ce4cb7912555b5bc66.mp4?t=1786608108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/32f9b8834f0851c6add093bd228df63a.webp?t=1786608108\" width=275 height=45 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight and maneuver your way through missions spread across 5 diverse locations:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Airport</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Mall</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Office</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Oilrig</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Clinic</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each sprawling map is reshaped by the game's Parametric Design System, offering new strategies and challenges with every play. The constantly evolving gameplay ensures every mission feels as thrilling and unique as your first, keeping the excitement alive in every campaign.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/0de11b8c7a3977eb73af1a6f54a6bb41.poster.avif?t=1786608108\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/0de11b8c7a3977eb73af1a6f54a6bb41.webm?t=1786608108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/0de11b8c7a3977eb73af1a6f54a6bb41.mp4?t=1786608108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/3024dc1fd4d7da98863f2cbffb1d8529.webp?t=1786608108\" width=275 height=45 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each MERX class has their own AI playstyle that packs a punch in their own unique way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Soldier</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/9d33be8a4f0df1157e0889a17b1714e9.poster.avif?t=1786608108\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/9d33be8a4f0df1157e0889a17b1714e9.webm?t=1786608108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/9d33be8a4f0df1157e0889a17b1714e9.mp4?t=1786608108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not to be underestimated, the soldier is the workhorse of the MERX squads. Soldiers will utilize their environment and work with other squad units to challenge Rogue Point head-on. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Berserker</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/c577e8b3f02de348b023a776630f8e7a.poster.avif?t=1786608108\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/c577e8b3f02de348b023a776630f8e7a.webm?t=1786608108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/c577e8b3f02de348b023a776630f8e7a.mp4?t=1786608108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Juiced up on substances and with no regard for their own life, the Berserker's singular goal is to close the distance and slice your whole team with a machete.  They are agents of chaos and will wreck your carefully crafted game plan. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sniper</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/31596871e2feb280c88c0e056eaf0ec2.poster.avif?t=1786608108\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/31596871e2feb280c88c0e056eaf0ec2.webm?t=1786608108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/31596871e2feb280c88c0e056eaf0ec2.mp4?t=1786608108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heavily fortified in the far distance, snipers will pin your team down and deny you entry into important areas.  Their only tell is the laser beam from their gun, and your teammate’s head exploding next to you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lookout</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/a6b228e084f862e239da6be741d41145.poster.avif?t=1786608108\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/a6b228e084f862e239da6be741d41145.webm?t=1786608108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/a6b228e084f862e239da6be741d41145.mp4?t=1786608108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick-footed and fast-talking, the Lookout disrupts your squad with flashbangs and relentless hit-and-run tactics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Heavy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/34c81781dd323367ace0c5c396b9ef8a.poster.avif?t=1786608108\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/34c81781dd323367ace0c5c396b9ef8a.webm?t=1786608108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/34c81781dd323367ace0c5c396b9ef8a.mp4?t=1786608108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heavies are big, slow brutes that don’t take cover and eat bullets.  You can dump all your ammo into them with no effect.  Run the other way, or find their one weakness. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>5-Star Mercenaries</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/e97a4c1ccb57bd58f3ced542cfdce906.poster.avif?t=1786608108\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/e97a4c1ccb57bd58f3ced542cfdce906.webm?t=1786608108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/e97a4c1ccb57bd58f3ced542cfdce906.mp4?t=1786608108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These legendary MERX have received the top-tier 5-star rating in the app. They should be approached with caution and treated as extremely dangerous to you and your team. Intel on these MERX is sketchy, but we know that these endgame encounters will require your team’s full strength to have a chance to take them down. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/093d7c099fc20832da1e9137a0143947.webp?t=1786608108\" width=275 height=45 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rogue Point is easy to learn and hard to master, perfect for both fresh recruits and seasoned veterans. Crave fast-paced action? How about slow, methodical, skill-driven gameplay? Rogue Point kicks open the door to both those worlds and invites players to choose their own playstyle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/1c95f71c6e2d36ae81910accf1a5a50e.webp?t=1786608108\" width=275 height=45 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn your keep on the frontlines to purchase new hardware for your arsenal. Start with nothing more than a pistol and an armored vest, then earn an elite arsenal through successful missions and strategic teamplay. Upgrade your loadout with an assortment of attachments and gear to get out alive. Own the battlefield on your terms.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/717d580c36e30c9221af18defa576e8e.webp?t=1786608108\" width=275 height=45 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together to battle against the MERX threat. Rogue Point is purpose-built to reinforce teamplay and pull players into combat. Plan, Adapt, and Overcome the odds by building your unique Rogue.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/ee62ff98bacdc28fadbb10a917711039.webp?t=1786608108\" width=275 height=45 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn money to buy weapons and gear. Buy the exact loadout you want or put your cash on the line for a chance at rare items only available through the Dead Drop system. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ Weapons, with multiple skins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ Tactical Items and Attachments for your arsenal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60+ Cosmetic Items, with multiple skins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ Mission Layouts, across 5 locations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/186a41394e50f6a0acc11e11c4adac7b.poster.avif?t=1786608108\" width=610 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/186a41394e50f6a0acc11e11c4adac7b.webm?t=1786608108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/186a41394e50f6a0acc11e11c4adac7b.mp4?t=1786608108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creators of Black Mesa: When the richest CEO on Earth dies, cutthroat conglomerates seek to carve up his kingdom. Using the MERX app, rival tycoons can order private mercenary armies as easily as takeout, making them perfect soldiers for the corporate war! Only Rogue Point, an elite vigilante squad, dares to fight back.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/af8175a6c5f9ec5db142cd2716c3bb06.poster.avif?t=1786608108\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/af8175a6c5f9ec5db142cd2716c3bb06.webm?t=1786608108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/af8175a6c5f9ec5db142cd2716c3bb06.mp4?t=1786608108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/71d7ac3fa83e5f2cb6e36e7932e10fd6.webp?t=1786608108\" width=275 height=45 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into an adrenaline-fueled campaign where explosive co-op firefights meet strategic planning. Team up, gather intel, complete objectives, and battle through dynamic missions. Earn skills and upgrade weapons to confront the 5 Star Mercenaries, lethal contractors who will test the limits of your team.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/46581ec70b8a93ce4cb7912555b5bc66.poster.avif?t=1786608108\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/46581ec70b8a93ce4cb7912555b5bc66.webm?t=1786608108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/46581ec70b8a93ce4cb7912555b5bc66.mp4?t=1786608108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/32f9b8834f0851c6add093bd228df63a.webp?t=1786608108\" width=275 height=45 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight and maneuver your way through missions spread across 5 diverse locations:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Airport</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Mall</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Office</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Oilrig</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Clinic</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each sprawling map is reshaped by the game's Parametric Design System, offering new strategies and challenges with every play. The constantly evolving gameplay ensures every mission feels as thrilling and unique as your first, keeping the excitement alive in every campaign.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/0de11b8c7a3977eb73af1a6f54a6bb41.poster.avif?t=1786608108\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/0de11b8c7a3977eb73af1a6f54a6bb41.webm?t=1786608108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/0de11b8c7a3977eb73af1a6f54a6bb41.mp4?t=1786608108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/3024dc1fd4d7da98863f2cbffb1d8529.webp?t=1786608108\" width=275 height=45 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each MERX class has their own AI playstyle that packs a punch in their own unique way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Soldier</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/9d33be8a4f0df1157e0889a17b1714e9.poster.avif?t=1786608108\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/9d33be8a4f0df1157e0889a17b1714e9.webm?t=1786608108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/9d33be8a4f0df1157e0889a17b1714e9.mp4?t=1786608108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not to be underestimated, the soldier is the workhorse of the MERX squads. Soldiers will utilize their environment and work with other squad units to challenge Rogue Point head-on. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Berserker</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/c577e8b3f02de348b023a776630f8e7a.poster.avif?t=1786608108\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/c577e8b3f02de348b023a776630f8e7a.webm?t=1786608108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/c577e8b3f02de348b023a776630f8e7a.mp4?t=1786608108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Juiced up on substances and with no regard for their own life, the Berserker's singular goal is to close the distance and slice your whole team with a machete.  They are agents of chaos and will wreck your carefully crafted game plan. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sniper</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/31596871e2feb280c88c0e056eaf0ec2.poster.avif?t=1786608108\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/31596871e2feb280c88c0e056eaf0ec2.webm?t=1786608108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/31596871e2feb280c88c0e056eaf0ec2.mp4?t=1786608108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heavily fortified in the far distance, snipers will pin your team down and deny you entry into important areas.  Their only tell is the laser beam from their gun, and your teammate’s head exploding next to you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lookout</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/a6b228e084f862e239da6be741d41145.poster.avif?t=1786608108\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/a6b228e084f862e239da6be741d41145.webm?t=1786608108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/a6b228e084f862e239da6be741d41145.mp4?t=1786608108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick-footed and fast-talking, the Lookout disrupts your squad with flashbangs and relentless hit-and-run tactics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Heavy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/34c81781dd323367ace0c5c396b9ef8a.poster.avif?t=1786608108\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/34c81781dd323367ace0c5c396b9ef8a.webm?t=1786608108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/34c81781dd323367ace0c5c396b9ef8a.mp4?t=1786608108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heavies are big, slow brutes that don’t take cover and eat bullets.  You can dump all your ammo into them with no effect.  Run the other way, or find their one weakness. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>5-Star Mercenaries</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/e97a4c1ccb57bd58f3ced542cfdce906.poster.avif?t=1786608108\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/e97a4c1ccb57bd58f3ced542cfdce906.webm?t=1786608108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/e97a4c1ccb57bd58f3ced542cfdce906.mp4?t=1786608108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These legendary MERX have received the top-tier 5-star rating in the app. They should be approached with caution and treated as extremely dangerous to you and your team. Intel on these MERX is sketchy, but we know that these endgame encounters will require your team’s full strength to have a chance to take them down. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/093d7c099fc20832da1e9137a0143947.webp?t=1786608108\" width=275 height=45 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rogue Point is easy to learn and hard to master, perfect for both fresh recruits and seasoned veterans. Crave fast-paced action? How about slow, methodical, skill-driven gameplay? Rogue Point kicks open the door to both those worlds and invites players to choose their own playstyle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/1c95f71c6e2d36ae81910accf1a5a50e.webp?t=1786608108\" width=275 height=45 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn your keep on the frontlines to purchase new hardware for your arsenal. Start with nothing more than a pistol and an armored vest, then earn an elite arsenal through successful missions and strategic teamplay. Upgrade your loadout with an assortment of attachments and gear to get out alive. Own the battlefield on your terms.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/717d580c36e30c9221af18defa576e8e.webp?t=1786608108\" width=275 height=45 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together to battle against the MERX threat. Rogue Point is purpose-built to reinforce teamplay and pull players into combat. Plan, Adapt, and Overcome the odds by building your unique Rogue.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/ee62ff98bacdc28fadbb10a917711039.webp?t=1786608108\" width=275 height=45 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn money to buy weapons and gear. Buy the exact loadout you want or put your cash on the line for a chance at rare items only available through the Dead Drop system. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ Weapons, with multiple skins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ Tactical Items and Attachments for your arsenal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60+ Cosmetic Items, with multiple skins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ Mission Layouts, across 5 locations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/186a41394e50f6a0acc11e11c4adac7b.poster.avif?t=1786608108\" width=610 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/186a41394e50f6a0acc11e11c4adac7b.webm?t=1786608108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/186a41394e50f6a0acc11e11c4adac7b.mp4?t=1786608108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p>", "short_description": "From the creators of Black Mesa: Welcome to Rogue Point! A 4-player co-op shooter where teamwork is everything. Join forces on intense missions with evolving objectives and powerful upgrades. Plan, Adapt, and Overcome. Your squad’s survival depends on it.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Polish, Simplified Chinese, Italian, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Russian, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese, Ukrainian, Portuguese - Brazil<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/f7813cb09da234430a30c090906b9796f659ebea/header.jpg?t=1786608108", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/56c1813ac6e95a73453b894170d7e8e95736644e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786608108", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/56c1813ac6e95a73453b894170d7e8e95736644e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786608108", "website": "https://playroguepoint.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-8700k / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 960 4 GB / AMD Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 13 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-8700